# OUTPUT — one plain-text essay
Structure (section header lines are allowed, NO markdown markers anywhere):
1. 摘要 — at most 320 characters: one sentence of project background (项目、角色、时间) + one explicit coverage statement that the essay answers all three questions (覆盖三问的声明).
2. 正文 — about 2200~2800 characters total, 按三问分三部分 (three parts, one per question):
   - 正文一、 answers Question 1: 项目概要 — background, scale, 组织与角色, overall architecture.
   - 正文二、 answers Question 2: 技术组成与实现 — the core technology's 选型理由、组成部分与具体实施, grounded in the project environment's tech background and tuning process.
   - 正文三、 answers Question 3: 实施效果与得失 — measurable results, 遇到的问题与对策, and a closing reflection.

Constraints:
- Plain text only: no markdown headings, no bold/italic markers, no bullet lists, no code fences. Section lines look like「摘要」and「正文一、…」.
- Every figure must trace back to the project environment above; missing figures become 约X / 近X or ____ — never an invented precise number.
- Write in Chinese, first person (我), 论文语体 (formal essay register); keep the three parts roughly balanced in length.
- Output ONLY the essay text itself — no preamble, no explanation before or after.
